Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:48:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1432/1463] HERESY 1496: a LoRA hidden or deleted for good; an
 adapter gone from loras/ asked about, never sent; the Trainer's epoch asks IN
 / OUT / Cancel; voice runs at rank 32
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Right-click on an adapter: Hide from the list (Show hidden in the LoRAs head, kept in yue2.lorasHidden), Delete from loras/ for good (the lab says what goes first). An adapter of the song gone from loras/: asked once the list comes, with those of a name like its own (the same run first, then the same voice at another rank or suffix), or out of the song; Later leaves it marked and Generate sends nothing until it is answered. The Trainer: no block under the epochs; a click asks IN / OUT / Cancel, a right-click gives the file. The Voice kind at rank 32 (Viktor: «нужно r32»). Kitchen suite 869/869.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
